      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": " KSTest ( Kolmogorov-Smirnov Test )\n- What it detects : Changes in feature distributions\n- More sophisticated : Uses statistical p-values\n- Best for : Rigorous statistical drift detection",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": " KSTest ( Kolmogorov-Smirnov Test )\n- What it detects : Changes in feature distributions\n- More sophisticated : Uses statistical p-values\n- Best for : Rigorous statistical drift detection",
